        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 722/400, Stainless Steel Designer Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Designer Stainless Steel Door Pull has a 15-3/4 inch center to center and a 17-5/16 inch overall length. It is available with thrubolt mounting or back to back mounting (must purchase 2 pulls). Made out of stainless steel, it comes with a brushed (satin) stainless steel finish. The modern appearance is great for contemporary spaces and the sharp lines make it easy to clean.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available <a href=\"/products/17-inch-designer-brushed-stainless-steel-appliance-pull-omnia-ap-722-400-us32d\"><b>Designer Brushed Stainless Steel Appliance Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Omnia 722/400 Rectangular Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 17-5/16\" </li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mounting Hole Spacing: 15-3/4\" (c.c.)</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rectangular Pull Bar Thickness: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rectangular Pull Bar Height: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Bracket Diameter: 1\" Round</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
